{"metadata":{"role":"project","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","title":"Swift Package integration","category":"Orange Unified Design System"},"kind":"project","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[{"chapter":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its librairies","backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These librairies help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"projectFiles":"OUDS-Onboarding-Tutorial.zip","xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 26.5","image":"ic_unified_ds.png","kind":"hero","title":"Swift Package integration","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10},{"tasks":[{"stepsSection":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Using Xcode, in your "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"project package dependencies","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", add a new "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"dependency","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Search with the GitHub repository URL (https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios), and select the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"ouds-ios","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" dependency."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can then choose the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"dependency rule","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" you want."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To know which version you need, you can have a look on the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/01-%E2%80%90-Available-API","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and also the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/releases","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"type":"step","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Let’s say you will use the some beta version, here 3.0.0-beta.8","type":"text"}]}],"media":"tutorial-onboarding-1-ouds-swift-package.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null},{"runtimePreview":null,"code":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you downloaded the package, you will see several librairies are available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They can be embeded inside your "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"target","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" librairies."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Things are separated to let users integrate only what they need and embed the abre minimum of content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesContract","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" library provides the main elements like the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":". The theme contract is defined inside it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesOrange","type":"text"}]},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesSosh","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Sosh products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesWireframe","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Wireframe theme, which is a theme dedicated to mockups and prototypes.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesOrangeCompact","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products but with constraints of sizes and spaces.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSComponents","type":"text"}]},{"text":" contains the SwiftUI OUDS components defined with the Figma specifications, and also useful view modifers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensRaw"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSTokensSemantic","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSTokensComponents","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" are librairies defining and providing the tokens for low level (raw),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle level (semantic) or component levels (high level).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSModules"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is for modules or rich components with extra logic.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSFoundations","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is dedicated to some utilities and shared logic.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add for example only the umbrella product merging all products mentioned above: ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUI","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],"media":"tutorial-onboarding-1-ouds-libraries.png"}],"contentSection":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS for iOS is an open source Swift Package available on GitHub under MIT license."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The package and the librairies must be added through Xcode."}]}],"mediaPosition":"trailing","kind":"contentAndMedia"}],"anchor":"Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","title":"Import the Swift Package and the libraries"}],"kind":"tasks"},{"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding","assessments":[{"title":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Which of these choices is correct?","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[],"choices":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"I can contribute to OUDS using pull request","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":true,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS is open source, under MIT license, and hosted on GitHub. Of course you can contribute!","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS supports officialy all Apple OS like visionOS, tvOS, watchOS, iPadOS, iOS and also CarPlay.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The main supported targets are iOS \/ iPadOS. However we do our best to support macOS, visionOS, tvOS and watchOS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CarPlay specific cases are not scoped yet.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS supports only SwiftUI."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides UIKit components"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"multiple-choice"},{"title":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Which imports of the OUDS Swift Package products can I choose?","type":"text"}]}],"content":[],"choices":[{"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can import all products provided by the Swift Package, and tailor your choice to keep only the ones needed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Even if we recommend to choose only the atomic products you need, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" product wraps all of them."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":true,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some of the available products depending to my needs, or only "},{"code":"OUDSSwiftUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if I am very lazy and don’t care about my app size."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You need to chose the products the Swift package provides.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"None, only the Swift package dependency matter.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"multiple-choice"}],"kind":"assessments"},{"featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial","abstract":[{"text":"Let’s suppose we want to define a view for corporate apps with headings, texts, buttons and images.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"How can we do that?"}],"action":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-2-nice-and-clear-view","isActive":true,"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}],"overridingTitle":"Get started","type":"reference"},"title":"Define information cards","kind":"callToAction"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/$volume","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies"]],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","modules":[{"projects":[{"sections":[{"kind":"task","refere